<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <title>Anmelden · Bockis Bot</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: dark;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      background: #0d1117;
      color: #e6edf3;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center; margin: 0; padding: 24px; }
    main { width: min(100%, 380px); padding: 28px; border: 1px solid #30363d; border-radius: 12px; background: #161b22; }
    h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 22px; }
    p { color: #8b949e; line-height: 1.5; }
    label { display: block; margin: 18px 0 6px; font-size: 14px; }
    input { width: 100%; padding: 11px 12px; border: 1px solid #30363d; border-radius: 6px; background: #0d1117; color: #e6edf3; font: inherit; }
    input:focus { outline: 2px solid #388bfd; outline-offset: 1px; }
    button { width: 100%; margin-top: 22px; padding: 11px; border: 0; border-radius: 6px; background: #238636; color: white; font: inherit; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; }
    button:hover { background: #2ea043; }
    .error { margin: 16px 0 0; color: #ff7b72; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <h1>Bockis Bot anmelden</h1>
    <p>Bitte melde dich mit deinem Dashboard-Konto an.</p>
    <% if (error) { %><p class="error" role="alert"><%= error %></p><% } %>
    <form method="post" action="/login">
      <label for="username">Benutzername</label>
      <input id="username" name="username" type="text" autocomplete="username" required autofocus>
      <label for="password">Passwort</label>
      <input id="password" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required>
      <button type="submit">Anmelden</button>
    </form>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
